        <mxCell id="note" value="Notas:  • Valores monetários em Int (centavos) — evita float.&#10;• Indexes em Customer.document (lookup da Lambda), Vehicle.plate, ServiceOrder(customerId,status), ServiceOrder(status,createdAt).&#10;• status como enum: Received, InDiagnosis, AwaitingApproval, InExecution, Finalized, Delivered.&#10;• User isolado (admin) — sem FK pra Customer; guard combinado diferencia pelo type do JWT." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
